Power incompatible with humans destroys the physical body.

7
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:51,460
To recover using that incompatible power only to use it again?

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,040
That is how far Shido is willing to go.

9
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:57,540
If it means seeing Touka, he'll do whatever it takes.

